<view class="dj-page"><view class="dj-title">把照片，留成一枚印记</view><view class="dj-note">自制章只记录记忆，不加分、不作为真实打卡证明。请把想留下的主体裁进框内，背景越简单越清楚。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="dj-error">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">拍照 / 从相册选择新照片</button><button wx:if="{{pendingUpload}}" class="dj-secondary" bindtap="retryUpload" disabled="{{busy}}">重试上传刚才的照片</button><block wx:if="{{job}}"><view class="dj-note">任务状态：{{job.status}} · {{job.namingSource}}</view><view wx:if="{{job.status !== 'READY'}}" class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-crop" style="width:{{viewport}}px;height:{{viewport}}px" catchtouchstart="start" catchtouchmove="move" catchtouchend="end" catchtouchcancel="end"><image wx:if="{{job.photoUrl}}" src="{{job.photoUrl}}" style="{{imageStyle}}" class="dj-crop-photo"/><view class="dj-crop-grid"/></view><view class="dj-note">拖动照片 / 双指缩放；方框内就是最终裁剪区域</view><slider disabled="{{busy}}" min="100" max="400" value="{{zoom}}" bindchange="zoom" activeColor="#B83A32"/><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="rotate" disabled="{{busy}}">顺时针旋转 90°</button><input disabled="{{busy}}" class="dj-input" value="{{title}}" maxlength="12" data-field="title" bindinput="field" placeholder="印章名称（最多12字）"/><picker disabled="{{busy}}" range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" data-field="categoryIndex" bindchange="field"><view class="dj-input">类别：{{categories[categoryIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="analyze" disabled="{{busy || !job.aiEnabled}}">可选：自动识别并建议名称</button><view class="dj-note">{{job.aiEnabled ? '识别仅辅助命名，可自行修改' : '未启用自动识别，可手动填写'}}；识别失败仍可继续。</view><picker disabled="{{busy}}" range="{{modes}}" value="{{modeIndex}}" data-field="modeIndex" bindchange="field"><view class="dj-input">处理模式：{{modes[modeIndex]}}</view></picker><view>深浅阈值 {{threshold}}</view><slider disabled="{{busy}}" min="25" max="230" value="{{threshold}}" data-field="threshold" bindchange="field" activeColor="#B83A32"/><label>浅色主体 / 深背景 <switch disabled="{{busy}}" checked="{{polarity}}" data-field="polarity" bindchange="field" color="#B83A32"/></label><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">按当前照片与参数生成预览</button></view><view wx:if="{{job.resultUrl || job.previewUrl}}" class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-note">{{dirty ? '参数已改动，请重新预览' : '本次照片处理结果 · 透明 PNG'}}</view><view class="dj-preview"><image class="dj-result" src="{{job.resultUrl || job.previewUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view></view><button wx:if="{{job.status !== 'READY'}}" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy || dirty || !job.previewUrl}}">确认正式生成（每日最多 3 枚）</button><button wx:if="{{job.status === 'READY'}}" bindtap="attach" disabled="{{busy || job.attached}}">{{job.attached ? '已添加到交子' : '确认添加到交子'}}</button><view wx:if="{{job.status === 'READY'}}" class="dj-note">已定稿结果不可覆盖；想改图请重新选择照片建立新任务。</view></block><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新 / 恢复任务状态</button><view wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">最近任务（服务端保存）</view><button wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="dj-secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openHistory">{{item.draft.title}} · {{item.status}}</button></view></view>
